.TH "POWERLINE-DAEMON" "1" "Dec 23, 2025" "beta" "Powerline"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
powerline-daemon \- Daemon that improves powerline performance.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
\fBpowerline\-daemon\fP [\fB\-\-quiet\fP] [\fB\-\-socket\fP=\fIS\fP] [\fB\-\-kill\fP] [\fB\-\-foreground\fP]
                 [\fB\-\-replace\fP]
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
\fB\-\-quiet\fP, \fB\-q\fP
Without other options: do not complain about already running powerline\-daemon instance. Will still exit with 1. With \fB\-\-kill\fP and \fB\-\-replace\fP: do not show any messages. With \fB\-\-foreground\fP: ignored. Does not silence exceptions in any case.
.TP
\fB\-\-socket\fP, \fB\-s\fP \fIS\fP
Specify socket which will be used for connecting to daemon.
.TP
\fB\-\-kill\fP, \fB\-k\fP
Kill an already running instance.
.TP
\fB\-\-foreground\fP, \fB\-f\fP
Run in the foreground (don\(aqt daemonize).
.TP
\fB\-\-replace\fP, \fB\-r\fP
Replace an already running instance.
.TP
\fB\-h\fP, \fB\-\-help\fP
Display help and exit.
.UNINDENT
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.sp
Written by Kim Silkebækken, Nikolay Pavlov, Kovid Goyal and contributors. The glyphs in the font patcher are created by Fabrizio Schiavi.
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
.sp
Report powerline\-daemon bugs to \%<https://\:github\:.com/\:powerline/\:powerline/\:issues>\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
\fBpowerline(1)\fP
